enchantment.trmtReinforce=Reinforcing
description.enchantment.trmtReinforce=Unlocks reinforce mode on the tool it is put on. A reinforced block resists blasts, in three levels, the last of them proof against anything; the same reinforcement hardens the ground against feet as well, each level adding another whole lifetime of traffic, so a road at the third level takes four times the walking to wear through. Every level costs a material to apply and can be taken off again afterwards. This enchantment has one level and goes only on the chunk tamper and the magic tamper.
