enchantment.trmtWard=Warding
description.enchantment.trmtWard=Unlocks spawn ward mode on the tool it is put on. A warded block will not let mobs spawn on it: hostiles and passives are barred separately, so a paddock can keep its animals and still refuse everything that comes out of the dark. The ward belongs to the block rather than to an area, so it holds exactly where it was put and nowhere else, and costs a material to apply. This enchantment has one level and goes only on the chunk tamper and the magic tamper.
