trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.range.desc=Works further from where it was set down.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.speed.desc=Gets round its work faster.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.sparing.desc=Spends half the durability on its tools.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.frugal.desc=Spends half the blocks on its mending.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.deep.desc=Four times the storage inside it.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.green.desc=Its order becomes the middle of a band rather than a place to stop, so its round breathes: worn down to one edge, mended back up to the other, and round again. What comes loose on the way down goes into its own store.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.stout.desc=Twice the health, and a point of it back each day.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.fierce.desc=Twice the force behind a blow. It still needs a tamper to throw one.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.settled.desc=Works out of the containers around its anchor: takes a tamper or a block to mend with when it runs out, and puts its surplus back - but only where that same thing is already kept.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.omni.desc=Every upgrade at once.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.unstable.desc=Every upgrade at once, and no grip on any of them. Three to nine are in force at a time, chosen afresh every minute; the storage is always one of them. A nether star settles it.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.tip=  Fits the golem's upgrade slot. One at a time.
trmtgtnh.golem.upgrade.renames=Renames it:
